>!blue [shadow] **Welcome.** This node links Må:rse radios across the internet and keeps mail for people who are away. It also shares a few pages.

::: cards 2
### [Page designs](demo)
Five pages that show what a .mu file can do: a newspaper, an old BBS, a pattern book, a live dashboard and a zine, plus a locked page.
+++
### [Pattern book](demo/patterns)
Every building block of a page with the text that makes it, ready to copy into your own pages.
:::

-> {small:{#8b969e:Pages are text, links and small pictures, never HTML · they work over LoRa and the internet}} <-
